  + [P3-S02_gate] is opened_by_P3-S01_completion_review
  + [P3-S03_gate] is gated_until_P3-S02
  + [P3-S04_gate] is gated_until_P3-S03
  + [P3-S05_gate] is gated_until_P3-S04
  + [P3-S06_gate] is gated_until_P3-S05
  + [P4_packetization_gate] is gated_until_P3_completion_or_explicit_rebake
  + [P5_LangGraph_runtime_gate] is gated_until_P3_and_fixture_contracts_advance
  + [P6_surface_projection_gate] is gated_until_P3_P4_and_fixture_records_advance
  + [operator_implementation_gate] is gated_until_future_source_preserved_implementation_activation
  + [adapter_dispatch_live_control_gate] is gated_until_future_source_preserved_SJS_authority

  = must: open only P3-S02 after P3-S01 completion review
  = must: keep all other downstream gates closed

